---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Dourados Game Hub - Comunidade de Game Devs" description="Rede colaborativa de artistas e desenvolvedores de jogos independentes em Dourados.">
  <section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pt-24 pb-16 px-6" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FDF6E3 0%, #FAF3E0 100%); border-bottom: 2px solid #2C1F15;">
    <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
    <div class="container mx-auto text-center max-w-4xl relative z-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: #C75B39;">Comunidade</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black mt-3 tracking-tight" style="color: #2C1F15;">Dourados <span class="gradient-text">Game Hub</span></h1>
      <p class="text-lg mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Ambiente colaborativo onde artistas e desenvolvedores trocam experiências.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-16 px-6" style="background: #FAF3E0;">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-8" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #2C1F15; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #2C1F15;">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4" style="color: #2C1F15;">Como funciona?</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">A rede funciona de forma não presencial e a participação nos projetos é feita de forma voluntária. Artistas e desenvolvedores independentes podem compartilhar ideias e produções.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-8" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #C75B39; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #C75B39;">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black mb-4" style="color: #2C1F15;">🚀 Projetos em Desenvolvimento</h3>
        <p style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Dois protótipos de games estão sendo desenvolvidos em parceria com integrantes do Hub:</p>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <a href="/portfolio/resilient-worms" class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl transition-all hover:translate-x-2" style="background: #FAF3E0; border: 2px solid #E8DFD0;">
            <span class="text-3xl">🐛</span>
            <div class="flex-1"><span class="font-bold" style="color: #2C1F15;">"Resilient Worms"</span><span class="block text-sm" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Game de Plataforma 2D</span></div>
            <span class="text-sm" style="color: #C75B39;">Ver projeto →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/portfolio/totoros-adventure" class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl transition-all hover:translate-x-2" style="background: #FAF3E0; border: 2px solid #E8DFD0;">
            <span class="text-3xl">🐱</span>
            <div class="flex-1"><span class="font-bold" style="color: #2C1F15;">"Totoro's Adventure"</span><span class="block text-sm" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Jogo Educativo</span></div>
            <span class="text-sm" style="color: #C75B39;">Ver projeto →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm mt-4" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">Contemplados no edital 09/2024 da Lei Paulo Gustavo, com lançamento previsto para setembro de 2025.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 text-center" style="background: #FDF6E3; border: 2px solid #2C1F15; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #2C1F15;">
        <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🤝</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4" style="color: #2C1F15;">Quer participar?</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.8;">Para se cadastrar no Dourados Game Hub, envie seu portfólio por email:</p>
        <a href="mailto:kaipestudio@gmail.com" class="btn-glow inline-block px-8 py-4 text-lg">📧 Enviar Portfólio</a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm" style="color: #4A3728; opacity: 0.6;">kaipestudio@gmail.com</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
